% party-example.l4
%
% The Logical English (for LPS) twin of the contracts of an L4 file (party-example.l4), written
% by the L4 translator (docs/migration/l4.md, step 3). Each obligation, permission or
% prohibition is a fluent that holds while it is open; the events are L4's, with the day
% L4 gives them as their last place. As L4's evaluator does, a missed deadline is
% noticed when something next happens, and that event does not count towards what
% follows. Each #TRACE of the file is a scenario; the comment above it is L4's result.
%
% DISCLAIMER. This program was written by a translator from a program of another
% system. It is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
% implied, including any warranty that it is accurate, complete or fit for a
% particular purpose. The translation may be wrong: check it against its source
% before relying on it. It is not legal, tax, insurance, financial or other
% professional advice. Its authors accept no liability for any loss or damage
% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 5.

the events are:
    the contract payment obligation starts on day *a day*; known as contract_payment_obligation_starts.
    *a party* does make payment with amount *an amount* on day *a day*; known as does_make_payment.
    something happens on day *a day*; known as something_happens_on_day.
    *a party* does something on day *a day*; known as does_something_on_day.
    the clock reaches day *a day*; known as the_clock_reaches_day.
    the contract early termination right starts on day *a day*; known as contract_early_termination_right_starts.
    *a party* does vacate premises on day *a day*; known as does_vacate_premises.
    the contract confidentiality obligation starts on day *a day*; known as contract_confidentiality_obligation_starts.
    the contract payment with penalty clause starts on day *a day*; known as contract_payment_with_penalty_clause_starts.
    the contract purchase and delivery contract starts on day *a day*; known as contract_purchase_and_delivery_contract_starts.
    *a party* does deliver goods with description *a description* on day *a day*; known as does_deliver_goods.
    the contract service agreement starts on day *a day*; known as contract_service_agreement_starts.
    *a party* does sign document with document name *a document name* on day *a day*; known as does_sign_document.
    *a party* does provide services on day *a day*; known as does_provide_services.
    *a party* does disclose confidential information on day *a day*; known as does_disclose_confidential_information.

the fluents are:
    payment obligation obliges *a party* to make payment with amount *an amount* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_payment_obligation_1.
    early termination right permits *a party* to vacate premises by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_early_termination_right_1.
    confidentiality obligation forbids *a party* to disclose confidential information by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_confidentiality_obligation_1.
    payment with penalty clause obliges *a party* to make payment with amount *an amount* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_payment_with_penalty_clause_1.
    purchase and delivery contract obliges *a party* to make payment with amount *an amount* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_purchase_and_delivery_contract_1.
    service agreement obliges *a party* to sign document with document name *a document name* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_service_agreement_1.
    the contract is fulfilled; known as the_contract_is_fulfilled.
    the contract is breached by *a party* missing the deadline of day *a deadline*; known as the_contract_is_breached_by_missing.
    the contract is breached by *a party* doing what was forbidden on day *a day*; known as the_contract_is_breached_by_doing.
    payment with penalty clause obliges *a party* to make payment with amount *an amount* by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_payment_with_penalty_clause_2.
    purchase and delivery contract obliges *a party* to deliver goods with description *a description* by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_purchase_and_delivery_contract_2.
    service agreement obliges *a party* to provide services by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_service_agreement_2.
    the contract is breached; known as the_contract_is_breached.
    service agreement obliges *a party* to make payment with amount *an amount* by day *a due day* as its third obligation; known as o_service_agreement_3.

