% The contract payment obligation starts: its first obligations.
when the contract payment obligation starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 30
then payment obligation obliges the_borrower to make payment with amount 5000 by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract early termination right starts: its first obligations.
when the contract early termination right starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 60
then early termination right permits the_tenant to vacate premises by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract confidentiality obligation starts: its first obligations.
when the contract confidentiality obligation starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 730
then confidentiality obligation forbids the_employee to disclose confidential information by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract payment with penalty clause starts: its first obligations.
when the contract payment with penalty clause starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 30
then payment with penalty clause obliges the_borrower to make payment with amount 1000 by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract purchase and delivery contract starts: its first obligations.
when the contract purchase and delivery contract starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 7
then purchase and delivery contract obliges the_buyer to make payment with amount 5000 by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract service agreement starts: its first obligations.
when the contract service agreement starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 7
then service agreement obliges the_employee to sign document with document name "employment contract" by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The first obligation of payment obligation: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does make payment with amount an amount on day a day
    and payment obligation obliges the party to make payment with amount the amount by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day <= the due day
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that payment obligation obliges the party to make payment with amount the amount by day the due day as its first obligation.

when something happens on day a day
    and payment obligation obliges a party to make payment with amount an amount by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day > the due day
then the contract is breached by the party missing the deadline of day the due day
    and it is not the case that payment obligation obliges the party to make payment with amount the amount by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The first obligation of early termination right: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does vacate premises on day a day
    and early termination right permits the party to vacate premises by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day <= the due day
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that early termination right permits the party to vacate premises by day the due day as its first obligation.

